# Flux source-controller artifact exclusions.
#
# This file OVERRIDES source-controller's default exclusion list, which strips
# image files (jpg/png/gif/...) from the artifact. We need
# apps/tachtit/homepage/assets/background.jpg to reach the kustomize build
# (configMapGenerator homepage-assets) — without this file the apps
# kustomization fails with "background.jpg: no such file or directory".
#
# Keep the artifact lean: exclude VCS metadata, docs, and repo-root diagrams,
# but let app asset images through.
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
docs/
Plans/
scripts/
graphify-out/
*.md
/gitops-workflow.png
/homelab-architecture.png
